  <entry>
    <title>青龙面板拉取脚本，互助码设置</title>
    <link href="/2026/08/07/%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E6%8B%89%E5%8F%96%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%92%E5%8A%A9%E7%A0%81%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/"/>
    <url>/2026/08/07/%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E6%8B%89%E5%8F%96%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BA%92%E5%8A%A9%E7%A0%81%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<hr><h2 id="title-青龙面板拉取脚本，互助码设置date-2022-07-31-04-05-25tags"><a href="#title-青龙面板拉取脚本，互助码设置date-2022-07-31-04-05-25tags" class="headerlink" title="title: 青龙面板拉取脚本，互助码设置date: 2022-07-31 04:05:25tags:"></a>title: 青龙面板拉取脚本，互助码设置<br>date: 2022-07-31 04:05:25<br>tags:</h2><p>﻿<img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/d56f1ee3f2d94db1aeb10e1630112ebf.png#pic_center"></p><h2 id="1，拉脚本库，附上大佬的拉库命令"><a href="#1，拉脚本库，附上大佬的拉库命令" class="headerlink" title="1，拉脚本库，附上大佬的拉库命令"></a>1，拉脚本库，附上大佬的拉库命令</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">ql repo https://github.com/KingRan/KR.git <span class="hljs-string">&quot;jd_|jx_|jdCookie&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;activity|backUp&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;^jd[^_]|USER|utils|function|sign|sendNotify|ql|JDJR&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>拉取不了就把配置文件config.sh第20行改下</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">https://pd.zwc365.com/cfworker/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/e83117ff5b3345f1b2798f8d15c9ef6f.png#pic_center"><br>脚本拉取完成后，下面添加ck</p><h2 id="2，设置环境变量"><a href="#2，设置环境变量" class="headerlink" title="2，设置环境变量"></a><strong>2，设置环境变量</strong></h2><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/d9569f3331374612a623dd622920ceb9.png#pic_center"><br>添加的ck可在宝塔面板的 &#x2F;root&#x2F;ql&#x2F;config，env.sh查看</p><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/78ba921ce97246fc9051d8464f3adecc.png#pic_center"><br>拉库拉不动，拉库失败，修改 HOST 可以直连 Github </p><p>SSH连接服务器，打开：&#x2F;etc&#x2F;hosts 在最后面添加</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">13.114.40.48 github.com<br>13.114.40.48 github.global.ssl.fastly.net<br>13.114.40.48 nodeload.github.com<br>13.114.40.48 api.github.com<br>13.114.40.48 codeload.github.com<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>或者直接替换代理连接</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">https://gh.fakev.cn/<br>https://hub.fastgit.xyz/<br>https://hub.0z.gs<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/b1e598044085404e8f0d7037b17e0b4c.png#pic_center"></p><h1 id="3，时间定时设置"><a href="#3，时间定时设置" class="headerlink" title="3，时间定时设置"></a>3，时间定时设置</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">(分 时 天 月 周)<br>20 */12 * * * 每12小时的20分<br>0 0,1-23/3 * * * 0点 1 点 后每3小时<br>13 1,6,22 * * * 1:13 6:13 22:13运行<br>0 20 30 * * 每月30日20点运行<br>0 20 * * 7 每周日20点<br>12 8 * * *每天8:12<br>0 0-23/1 * * * 每小时一次<br>58 0,9,19 * * * 0点58，09点58，19点58运行，每天3次<br>0 8,14 * * * 每天8点，14点运行，每天2次<br> */15 6-23 * * * 每15分钟运行<br> 30 3-23/8 * * * 03.30，11.30，19.30运行，每8小时运行，每天3次<br> 0 1-23/4 * * * 每4小时运行，每天6次<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>定时规则可以到这里查看：<a href="https://tool.lu/crontab/">执行时间计算</a></p><h1 id="4，开卡变量，复制下面代码到配置文件-config-sh"><a href="#4，开卡变量，复制下面代码到配置文件-config-sh" class="headerlink" title="4，开卡变量，复制下面代码到配置文件 config.sh"></a>4，开卡变量，复制下面代码到配置文件 config.sh</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment">## 开卡——所有（匹配24及以后的开卡脚本）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> guaopencard_All=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 加购物车——所有（匹配24及以后的开卡脚本）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> guaopencard_addSku_All=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 执行任务——所有（匹配24及以后的开卡脚本）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> guaopencardRun_All=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 抽奖——所有（匹配24及以后的开卡脚本）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> guaopencard_draw=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> guaopenwait_All=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;60&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> guaunknownTask_addSku_All=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> guaopencard=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> exjxbeans==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> FALR_MODE=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;true&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> CHETOU_NUMBER=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;5&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="5，青龙面板路径，方便备份"><a href="#5，青龙面板路径，方便备份" class="headerlink" title="5，青龙面板路径，方便备份"></a>5，青龙面板路径，方便备份</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">1.CK文件 <span class="hljs-comment"># JD_cookie</span><br>/root/ql/config/env.sh<br>2.配置文件<br>/root/ql/config/config.sh<br>3.脚本目录<br>/root/ql/scripts<br>4.定时任务<br>/root/ql/config/crontab.list<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="6，助力码设置"><a href="#6，助力码设置" class="headerlink" title="6，助力码设置"></a>6，助力码设置</h1><p>助力码下载地址：<a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1QHKvbxWdpnK_7Ip-sNyfSw?pwd=77fm">青龙互助文件</a></p><p>1，把 code.sh   task_before.sh  文件放到 ql&#x2F;config 目录下<br>2，青龙添加任务即可<br><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/3389326a32a0426f9ee6e714ba10b6aa.png#pic_center"></p><p>如需更改调用哪个脚本日志， 在 code.sh 自行更改<br><img src="https://img-blog.csdnimg.cn/ec1667506e1d4675a6e590aaa2007d25.png#pic_center"></p><p>获取互助码成功的前提条件：你必须运行过相应的脚本，形成了日志，它才可以读取和合并你的互助码</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
